1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,106
A pinned knight can make a capture look completely safe.

2
00:00:04,186 --> 00:00:08,291
The Queen's Gambit structure hides the tactical detail.

3
00:00:08,371 --> 00:00:12,477
White pins the knight and prepares to win material.

4
00:00:12,557 --> 00:00:16,663
Black supports the center and attacks the queen side.

5
00:00:16,743 --> 00:00:20,849
The queen check adds pressure before the trap closes.

6
00:00:20,929 --> 00:00:25,034
Black takes the pawn and appears to win a piece.

7
00:00:25,114 --> 00:00:29,220
The bishop removes the pinned knight and the trap is sprung.
